  "generated_text": "1. **Factorize the number 2004:**\n   \\[\n   2004 = 2^2 \\cdot 501\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   501 = 3 \\cdot 167\n   \\]\n\n2. **Determine the number of divisors of 2004:**\n   \\[\n   2004 = 2^2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 167\n   \\]\n   The number of divisors is given by:\n   \\[\n   (2+1)(1+1)(1+1) = 3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 = 24\n   \\]\n\n3. **Determine the number of divisors of \\(2004^{2004}\\):**\n   \\[\n   2004^{2004} = (2^2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 167)^{2004}\n   \\]\n   The number of divisors is given by:\n   \\[\n   (2004+1)(2004+1)(2004+1) = (20",
  "grade": {
